43 contains `forceRefreshToken`, returning `Promise<string | null | undefined>`.
44 Cortex intentionally narrows absence to `null`. The constructor calls
45 `credentials.bindReactiveClient(client)` and attaches a dedicated safe adapter
46 through that official API. Normal reactive refresh requests reach the host unchanged.
47 The installed auth manager refreshes the active socket identity, so subscriptions
